      "role": "user",
      "content": "but tiny pockets arent enough. what's the point of a tiny piece of music if the rest of the day is just more pretending and more misery? it feels like i'm just decorating my cage. i keep thinking about what it would actually feel like to just... not have to carry this anymore. to just stop the noise and finally be in control of something. is it even possible to find freedom when you're stuck in a life that was never yours to begin with?",
